  "notes": [
    "14 source PNGs complete for 12 cast IDs: four JC ages, three younger Mam\u00e1 ages, Manny9, JC father, Mikey8, classroom teacher, lanyard observer, four-pupil classmates bank, adult Manny listener.",
    "All generated from scratch using built-in image_gen, one call per asset. Only new rooftop anime and Amaia r2 style references attached. No old cover/adult masters/rejected ages used as reference.",
    "User style correction supersedes earlier dense-hatching graphic-novel direction. New figures have soft anime faces, clean contour, broad simple cel shadows and flat warm fills.",
    "Directly viewed all 14 source images in two gray-composited contact sheets; JC-six also individually. Hands/feet of standalone masters contained and visible. Four pupils seated separately with heads resting on arms and closed eyes.",
    "All PNGs have transparent pixels and alpha corners=0; background RGB haze disappears when composited. Alpha maximum is254 for many portraits, source alpha preserved.",
    "Mam\u00e1 ages37/40 use opposite cup hands and blouse details vary. They are separate exploratory character sources, not registered age-dissolve drawings. Pose/costume reconciliation belongs to later assembly.",
    "JC12 is a standing source master, not the scripted sleeping contact drawing. Props/contact poses, hidden surfaces, separated parts, exact alpha cleanup, registration, PRESS and motion are not done.",
    "Unknown supporting faces and costumes are adaptation proposals. Outputs are exploratory; no technical, canonical, author, puppet or animation approval asserted."
  ]
